<title>GERMANY: AgrEvo says no current plans for bourse listing.</title>
<headline>AgrEvo says no current plans for bourse listing.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>AgrEvo, a joint venture between Germany's Schering AG and Hoechst AG, will not be listed on the bourse in the near-term, a top Schering official said in a newspaper interview on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Schering deputy management board chairman Klaus Pohle told the Zurich newspaper &quot;Finanz und Wirtschaft&quot; that a listing at the moment would not be very useful.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
